<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Lojas Arapua Q1 net income up.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Lojas Arapua Q1 net income up.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO, Brazil 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			 1996</p>
<p> Net		 9,234		    5,460</p>
<p> Gross oper inc. 514,426		  373,125</p>
<p>(All data above in Brazilian reais 000s using monetary correction method)</p>
<p>NOTE: Under corporations law accounting, the company reported net income of 12.8 million reais in the first quarter of 1997, which represents 3.2 percent of net sales.</p>
<p>This represents an increase of 104 percent over the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>Net earnings per 1,000 shares were 0.42 real in the first quarter.</p>
</text>
